# NOTE: do NOT ignore drizzle/meta/. drizzle-kit needs _journal.json and the
# snapshots committed to generate correct diffs — without them the next
# `db:generate` silently emits a full CREATE TABLE baseline instead of an ALTER.
# (There used to be a `drizzle/meta/` rule here. Because the pattern has an
# interior slash git anchored it to v2/drizzle/meta/, which doesn't exist, so it
# never actually matched backend/drizzle/meta/ — but it was one normalization to
# `**/drizzle/meta/` away from deleting our migration history.)

# TypeScript incremental build cache — per-dev state, not shared
*.tsbuildinfo
